(Python Asyncio Internals - Event Loop Scheduling) Tj
T* (Python asyncio executes coroutines cooperatively on a single-threaded event loop.) Tj
T* (When a coroutine reaches an await expression on an I/O future, control yields back) Tj
T* (to the event loop so other ready tasks can make forward progress without OS threads.) Tj
T* (Blocking system calls such as time.sleep stall every concurrent task on the loop.) Tj
T* (CPU-bound or synchronous I/O routines should be offloaded via asyncio.to_thread.) Tj
ET
