(Graceful Shutdown and CancelledError Discipline) Tj
T* (During graceful shutdown, pending tasks receive asyncio.CancelledError at their next) Tj
T* (await point. Services should catch asyncio.CancelledError only to run cleanup blocks) Tj
T* (such as flushing SQLite transactions or closing httpx AsyncClient pools, and then) Tj
T* (re-raise CancelledError unless intentionally terminating the supervisor loop.) Tj
T* (Structured cancellation prevents zombie background tasks and resource leaks.) Tj
ET
